# Section 4, the prescription commands on Cassegrain.in: OLD, LOAD, VALIDATE (a sound deck, and a copy with
# its first KcElt= emptied), MODify (help, a change, a failure, the two vector forms), STATUS before and
# after RESET (after an OPD, a SPOT and the SLICE plot type, so there is state to reset).
# COPY: $ROOT/docs/macos-manual/examples/Cassegrain.in s04
cd $TMP/s04
! perl -pe 's/^(\s*KcElt=).*$/$1/ if /KcElt=/ && !$d++' Cassegrain.in > Cassegrain_bad.in
pgd
/null
# TRANSCRIPT: s04_old
old Cassegrain
# TRANSCRIPT: s04_loa
loa Cassegrain
# TRANSCRIPT: s04_validate
validate Cassegrain
# TRANSCRIPT: s04_validate_bad
validate Cassegrain_bad
# TRANSCRIPT: s04_mod_help
mod
help
q
# TRANSCRIPT: s04_mod_ecc
mod
eElt(2)=1.03
q
# TRANSCRIPT: s04_mod_fail
mod
eeElt(2)=1.04
q
# TRANSCRIPT: s04_mod_vec1
mod
VptElt(3,2)=4.2
q
# TRANSCRIPT: s04_mod_vec2
mod
VptElt(:,2)=1.0,0.0,3.0
q
# TRANSCRIPT-OFF
old Cassegrain
opd 4
spot 5 Tout
slice
# TRANSCRIPT: s04_status
status
# TRANSCRIPT: s04_reset_status
reset
status
# TRANSCRIPT-OFF
# EXPECT: Tracing rays past\s+5 elements
# EXPECT: Cassegrain\.in: OK
# EXPECT: Cassegrain_bad\.in: line 38: key "KcElt" has no value
# EXPECT: MODify Syntax Examples:[\s\S]*?Quit: quit Modify function\.
# EXPECT: eElt\(\s*2\) =\s+1\.030000000D\+00\s+KcElt\(\s*2\) =\s+-1\.060900000D\+00\s+KrElt\(\s*2\) =\s+-1\.096200000D\+01
# EXPECT: MOD: \[q\]: eeElt\(2\)=1\.04\s+MOD: \[q\]: q
# EXPECT: VptElt\(\s*2\) =\s+0\.0+D\+00\s+0\.0+D\+00\s+4\.200000000D\+00
# EXPECT: VptElt\(\s*2\) =\s+1\.000000000D\+00\s+0\.0+D\+00\s+3\.000000000D\+00
# EXPECT: Current WF plot type=SLICE[\s\S]*?MACOS> reset[\s\S]*?Current element for OPD calculations=\s+0
# EXPECT-NOT: forrtl
